/T (This project was being carried out through a high-accuracy Final Location Survey \(FLS\) for the doubling of the railway track between Prayagraj and Naini stations. Using drone-based photogrammetry and detailed topographical mapping, precise terrain, alignment, and structural information was provided, as required for engineering design and planning. The deliverables are used to support the preparation of alignment plans, ESP/yard layouts, longitudinal sections, and cross-sections for the track-doubling project near Naini Bridge.)
