780 0 obj
<<
/Title (The project was carried out through a detailed topographical survey using drone-based photogrammetry. The data acquisition was undertaken to support feasibility studies and detailed engineering for the rehabilitation and upgradation of the highway. The primary objective was to ensure that high-accuracy terrain and elevation datasets were generated to facilitate design planning, alignment optimization, and infrastructure development in challenging mountainous terrain.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 402 0 R
>>
