1213 0 obj
<<
/Title (The processing and analysis of LiDAR data was carried out to generate high-accuracy terrain products for a selected area in Australia. The LiDAR point cloud was classified into meaningful land-surface and object categories, and key elevation-based datasets, including the Digital Terrain Model \(DTM\), Digital Surface Model \(DSM\), and contour layers, were developed. Advanced LiDAR classification techniques were applied to separate ground, vegetation, buildings, and other surface features, ensuring that a clean and reliable dataset was produced.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 782 0 R
/Prev 1212 0 R
/First 1391 0 R
/Last 1391 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
