/Title (This project was carried out through a high-resolution Drone LiDAR Survey for the proposed road alignment in Aizawl, Mizoram, covering approximately 50 km with a minimum 200-meter ROW \(100 m on each side of the centerline\). The survey was conducted using UAV-based LiDAR technology to ensure that precise terrain and surface information was captured, which was required for design feasibility and engineering analysis.)
